        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 220406, 6 Inch Sandcast Bronze Recessed Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 6 Inch Sandcast Bronze Recessed Pull is for use on lightweight doors and drawers. Flush pulls like this one are most often used on sliding barn door pulls since they are mortised into the face of the door and can fit into the pocket. The Sandcast Bronze 6 Inch Flush Pull has a 1/8 inch projection. Choose from flat black, medium bronze, and tumble white bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-220406-specifications.gif?v=1704354728 \"width=\"430\" height=\"345\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 220406 Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-4-inch-flush-pull-emtek-220404\"><b>4\" Flush Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-8-inch-flush-pull-emtek-220408\"><b>8\" Flush Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-10-inch-flush-pull-emtek-220410\"><b>10\" Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 6 Inch Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-220406-specifications.pdf?v=1704262375\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 220406 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
